# Shell installers MUST stay LF (a CRLF checkout makes `bash install.sh`
# fail with "\r: command not found" on every Linux/macOS/Termux host) and
# batch files MUST stay CRLF (cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only .bat in for/if
# blocks). Enforce both at checkout so platform bugs can't ride in through
# git autocrlf settings.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
